# ── Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTE: the ATBU project deliberately tracked .env for a two-device sync
# workflow, and then had to live with real API keys in git history. Do not
# repeat that here.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.key
*.pem

# ── Editors / OS ────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Logs & scratch ──────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.bak
node_modules/

# ── NOT ignored, deliberately ───────────────────────────
# index.html and B2TW_Eval360_User_Guide.html are generated by
# scripts/build-guide.js, and are committed on purpose: a server without Node
# still has something to serve, and deploy_pull.sh rebuilds them when it can,
# so a stale committed copy self-corrects on the next deploy.
